feat(observability): add pgx database monitoring with OTel metrics

From: Prasanth Baskar <bupdprasanth@gmail.com>

Add OpenTelemetry-based database observability for pgxpool connections.
Includes query tracing, pool status metrics (idle/total/acquired conns),
and Prometheus metric export via OTel-to-Prometheus bridge.

Uses the dbpool.Option extension point from the OSS pgx/v5 migration
to inject monitoring without modifying pool.go.

